  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Border Security in Burkina Faso</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project pursues the overall objective of supporting the Government of BF to improve the capacities of the authorities in charge of border security to ensure effective and efficient border control. This will be done through the installation of MIDAS to better control the movement of goods and people at the borders and appropriate training for front-line agents.</narrative>
  </description>
